# Internal working notes — strategy, research, product thinking. Not published.
# `notes/*` rather than `notes/`, because git never looks inside a folder it has
# been told to ignore, so nothing under one can be let back out. Release notes
# are let back out: they are the release body, read by the release workflow on a
# runner that has only what is committed here.
notes/*
!notes/releases/
CLAUDE.md

release/
build/icon.iconset/

# The landing page's raw 2x captures. `site/scripts/shots.mjs` makes these again
# from the running app, so only the ones it cannot make are kept: the whole-window
# shots of the real desktop app, and the details cropped out of them by hand.
site/assets/shots/*
!site/assets/shots/app-*.png
!site/assets/shots/crop-*.png

# Subagent scratch: what a helper was asked, what it said, its transcript.
# Runtime state, not project config — .pi/hooks.json and .pi/mcp.json stay.
.pi/subagents/
